OL,3,ABurnham's Number 10 North goes on
OL,4,Amulti-million pound hiring spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham's Number 10 North has gone
OL,7,Fon a multi-million pound hiring spree
OL,8,Fwith dozens of new jobs being
OL,9,Fadvertised.
OL,11,FThe office in Manchester, set up by the
OL,12,Fprime minister in July, has launched 50
OL,13,Fexternal job adverts, including a
OL,14,F"rewiring the state deputy director".
OL,16,FIt is the latest sign of how pivotal
OL,17,Fthe government outpost - designed as a
OL,18,Fsister office to London's Downing
OL,19,FStreet - may prove to Burnham's aim to
OL,20,Fdevolve power across the country.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
